Sorry, sir.
ຂໍໂທດເດີເດີ.

32
00:03:06,495 --> 00:03:08,329
Never mind, Baggaley.
ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ, Baggaley.

33
00:03:08,331 --> 00:03:11,365
Your concealment and camouflage
